designate: drop rootwrap configuration.

Designate removed oslo.rootwrap in "Remove oslo.rootwrap dependency"
(designate commit c333e687a0): etc/designate/rootwrap.conf and the
designate-rootwrap console script are gone, and root_helper is now a
deprecated no-op because rndc runs as the designate worker user.

designate-base still rewrites exec_dirs in that file, so the image no
longer builds against designate master:

  sed: can't read /etc/designate/rootwrap.conf: No such file or directory

Drop the sed, and the sudoers entry that granted the kolla group root
via designate-rootwrap, since the binary it names no longer exists.

Prompt: Michael asked for the designate-base build failure blocking
the kerbside-patches merge queue to be fixed.

